From 4d086dc6d1d4641b1f732d5e74c916a5a0f3d536 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2025 17:54:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: configs: add stm32mp_defconfig fragments

Drop from stm32mp_defconfig all the architecture, machine and SoC
except ARCH_STM32.
This prevents such compile flags to turn on other compile flags
not relevant for ARCH_STM32.
This also helps highlighting the dependencies required by
ARCH_STM32 that were enabled by the other machines.

Add the fragments to further filter the configuration.

Signed-off-by: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I92b42bd0fb440dd0f0a4ccb06138694af72538d9
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/534109
